#compdef pmap_chunked

# Chunked parallel map: `pmap_chunked N 'cmd {}' ARG...` — N arguments per shell process.
#
# zshrs builtin; keep in sync with builtin_pmap_chunked (src/extensions/ext_builtins.rs).
# Bundled into ~/.zshrs/functions by build.rs.

_arguments \
    '1:chunk size:' \
    '2:command template ({} is replaced by each argument):_cmdstring' \
    '*:argument:_default'
